      "content": "thanks. the 137 exit code definitely points to OOMKilled so i'll check the limits first. but i'm also seeing some weirdness where the logs seem to just cut off right before the crash happens, almost like something is messing with the logging agent or the container runtime itself. could it be an issue with the node, or is it more likely something internal to the pod configuration? what else should i check to rule out the environment being the problem?",
      "source": "evaluator"
